WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.393
You changed the UI. The tests are green.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.030
But does it feel right?

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.215
Meet UX quality check: a UX eye for your coding agent.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:16.048
It reads your diff, opens the page, and measures it: at rest, on hover, and on focus.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.670
Hover a row, and the whole list jumps.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.055
Caught.

7
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.737
A Post button that stays enabled while it posts sends the comment twice.

8
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.299
Caught again.

9
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.481
Gray text that passes in light mode fails in dark.

10
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.448
Caught. Every time.

11
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:40.618
52 rules in six groups, each with a check in code and a check in the browser.

12
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.667
Every finding comes with evidence, and a fix.

13
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.591
UX quality check. Ship UI that feels finished.
